      "text": "Whereas, Pursuant to the above-mentioned charter, the Municipal Service Adminis-\ntration shall, together with the Director of Management and Budget, establish the New\nYork City government's overall policy with regard to energy conservation in all municipal\nbuildings and facilities.",
